157
00:21:36,141 --> 00:21:37,517
<i>É claro.</i>

158
00:21:37,518 --> 00:21:39,589
<i>Deixe-me lhe dar o endereço.</i>

159
00:22:11,617 --> 00:22:13,193
- Ei.
- Vamos sair.

160
00:22:13,294 --> 00:22:14,876
